<title>USA: New Castle County, Del., votes on $24 mln bonds.</title>
<headline>New Castle County, Del., votes on $24 mln bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CASTLE COUNTY, Del. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in Appoquinimink School District, Del., go to the polls Tuesday to decide the fate of a $24 million bond issue that could push annual taxes up by an average of $60.</p>
<p>About $8 million of the proceeds would be used to build an elementary school, and the rest would help renovate other school buildings in the district.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
